{"type":"message","id":"e7aafc22","parentId":"5697172f","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:40:38.997Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-05-23 05:40 UTC] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]\n\nRead the Feishu wiki document at token O0QTw8b4Ai2qBdkB5sUcZVdFn6f and extract its content. \n\nSteps:\n1. Use feishu_wiki action=\"get\" with token=\"O0QTw…n6f\" to get the obj_token\n2. Use feishu_doc action=\"read\" with the obj_token from step 1 to read the document content\n3. Return the full content of the document, especially the section about \"6条v0.4重点修复\" and \"potentialBoost解耦\" (item #5)\n\nThe workspace is /home/node/.openclaw/workspace. Just do these 2 tool calls and return the results.\n\nBegin. Execute the assigned task to completion."}],"timestamp":1779514838859}}
{"type":"message","id":"3b9412fc","parentId":"e7aafc22","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:40:42.351Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me read the feishu_wiki skill to understand how to use it properly.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-1c61594f-6492-4f29-94f5-a2e163f4a19d","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/plugin-skills/feishu-wiki/SKILL.md"},"partialArgs":"{\"path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/plugin-skills/feishu-wiki/SKILL.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":8532,"output":61,"cacheRead":48,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":8641,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779514839019,"responseId":"chatcmpl-2f10de40-1157-42f4-89bd-8141c01fe0e9"}}
{"type":"message","id":"1619749c","parentId":"3b9412fc","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:40:42.430Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call-1c61594f-6492-4f29-94f5-a2e163f4a19d","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: feishu-wiki\ndescription: |\n  Feishu knowledge base navigation. Activate when user mentions knowledge base, wiki, or wiki links.\n---\n\n# Feishu Wiki Tool\n\nSingle tool `feishu_wiki` for knowledge base operations.\n\nWiki `space_id` values are opaque strings. Always keep them quoted in tool calls, even when they contain only digits; passing a long numeric-looking ID as a number can corrupt the suffix due to JavaScript number precision limits.\n\n## Token Extraction\n\nFrom URL `https://xxx.feishu.cn/wiki/ABC123def` → `token` = `ABC123def`\n\n## Actions\n\n### List Knowledge Spaces\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"spaces\" }\n```\n\nReturns all accessible wiki spaces.\n\n### List Nodes\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"nodes\", \"space_id\": \"7xxx\" }\n```\n\nWith parent:\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"nodes\", \"space_id\": \"7xxx\", \"parent_node_token\": \"wikcnXXX\" }\n```\n\n### Get Node Details\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"get\", \"token\": \"***\" }\n```\n\nReturns: `node_token`, `obj_token`, `obj_type`, etc. Use `obj_token` with `feishu_doc` to read/write the document.\n\n### Create Node\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"create\", \"space_id\": \"7xxx\", \"title\": \"New Page\" }\n```\n\nWith type and parent:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"create\",\n  \"space_id\": \"7xxx\",\n  \"title\": \"Sheet\",\n  \"obj_type\": \"sheet\",\n  \"parent_node_token\": \"wikcnXXX\"\n}\n```\n\n`obj_type`: `docx` (default), `sheet`, `bitable`, `mindnote`, `file`, `doc`, `slides`\n\n### Move Node\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"move\", \"space_id\": \"7xxx\", \"node_token\": \"wikcnXXX\" }\n```\n\nTo different location:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"move\",\n  \"space_id\": \"7xxx\",\n  \"node_token\": \"wikcnXXX\",\n  \"target_space_id\": \"7yyy\",\n  \"target_parent_token\": \"wikcnYYY\"\n}\n```\n\n### Rename Node\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"rename\", \"space_id\": \"7xxx\", \"node_token\": \"wikcnXXX\", \"title\": \"New Title\" }\n```\n\n## Wiki-Doc Workflow\n\nTo edit a wiki page:\n\n1. Get node: `{ \"action\": \"get\", \"token\": \"***\" }` → returns `obj_token`\n2. Read doc: `feishu_doc { \"action\": \"read\", \"doc_token\": \"obj_token\" }`\n3. Write doc: `feishu_doc { \"action\": \"write\", \"doc_token\": \"obj_token\", \"content\": \"...\" }`\n\n## Configuration\n\n```yaml\nchannels:\n  feishu:\n    tools:\n      wiki: true # default: true\n      doc: true # required - wiki content uses feishu_doc\n```\n\n**Dependency:** This tool requires `feishu_doc` to be enabled. Wiki pages are documents - use `feishu_wiki` to navigate, then `feishu_doc` to read/edit content.\n\n## Permissions\n\nRequired: `wiki:wiki` or `wiki:wiki:readonly`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779514842428}}
